sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User / Postman
    participant Gateway as API Gateway (Port 3000)
    participant Auth as Auth Service (Port 3001)
    participant Account as Account Service (Port 3002)
    participant Txn as Transaction Service (Port 3003)
    participant Kafka as Kafka Broker

    %% STEP 1: AUTH
    rect rgb(235, 245, 255)
    Note over User, Auth: Step 1: User Registration & Authentication
    User->>Gateway: 1. POST /api/v1/auth/register (name, email, password)
    Gateway->>Auth: Forward Registration
    Auth-->>User: 201 Created (User Registered)

    User->>Gateway: 2. POST /api/v1/auth/login (email, password)
    Gateway->>Auth: Forward Login
    Auth-->>User: 200 OK (Returns JWT Token)
    end

    %% STEP 2: ACCOUNTS
    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
    Note over User, Account: Step 2: Create Accounts & Deposit Initial Balance
    User->>Gateway: 3. POST /api/v1/accounts (Header: Bearer Token)
    Gateway->>Account: Forward Account Creation
    Account-->>User: 201 Created (Account Created: ACC101, Balance: $0)

    User->>Gateway: 4. POST /api/v1/accounts/internal/transaction (Deposit $500 into ACC101)
    Gateway->>Account: Forward Manual Deposit
    Account-->>User: 200 OK (ACC101 Balance: $500)
    end

    %% STEP 3: TRANSACTION & SAGA
    rect rgb(255, 245, 235)
    Note over User, Kafka: Step 3: Distributed Money Transfer (Saga Pattern)
    User->>Gateway: 5. POST /api/v1/transaction/transfer (ACC101 -> ACC202, $200)
    Gateway->>Txn: Forward Transfer Request
    Note over Txn: Save Transaction Status: INITIATED
    Txn->>Kafka: Publish Event: TRANSACTION_INITIATED
    Txn-->>User: 201 Created (Returns transactionId: TXN_99)

    Kafka->>Account: Consume: TRANSACTION_INITIATED
    Note over Account: Debits $200 from ACC101 (New Balance: $300)
    Account->>Kafka: Publish Event: ACCOUNT_DEBITED

    Kafka->>Txn: Consume: ACCOUNT_DEBITED
    Note over Txn: Update Status: DEBIT_SUCCESS

    Kafka->>Account: Consume: ACCOUNT_DEBITED
    Note over Account: Credits $200 to ACC202 (New Balance: $200)
    Account->>Kafka: Publish Event: ACCOUNT_CREDITED

    Kafka->>Txn: Consume: ACCOUNT_CREDITED
    Note over Txn: Update Status: COMPLETED
    end

    %% STEP 4: VERIFICATION
    rect rgb(250, 240, 255)
    Note over User, Txn: Step 4: Verify Transaction Result
    User->>Gateway: 6. GET /api/v1/transaction/TXN_99
    Gateway->>Txn: Forward Query
    Txn-->>User: 200 OK (Status: COMPLETED, SourceDebited: $200, DestinationCredited: $200)
    end
